flowchart TB
    Upload[上传 PDF / 图片] --> Store[uploads/{batch_id}\n保存原件]
    Store --> Parse[parse_agent.parse_files]
    Parse --> Field[结构化字段\nvalue + confidence]
    Parse --> Source[source\npage + bbox]
    Field --> Document[Document.fields\n写入任务]
    Source --> Document
    Document --> Rule[rule_engine\n规则核对]
    Document --> Special[review_agent\n专项审核]
    Rule --> Result[CheckResult.detail]
    Special --> Result
    Source --> Result
    Result --> API[TaskDetail / Results API]
    API --> Table[前端结果表\n显示问题与来源]
    API --> Viewer[PdfSourceViewer]
    Store --> Viewer
    Viewer --> Highlight[指定页 + bbox\n原文高亮]

    Confidence{confidence < 0.8?}
    Field --> Confidence
    Confidence -- 是 --> Review[人工复核提示]
    Confidence -- 否 --> Rule
    Review --> Document
